{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_01",
      "hash": "e9b56ce052d8e502",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是紫苑鎮\\n紫苑即是氣質高貴的紫蘭之色"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_02",
      "hash": "e9b56be052d8e34f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "連看不見的寶可夢也能清楚看到？\\n新商品！西爾佛檢視鏡！\\c\\n……西爾佛公司"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_03",
      "hash": "e9b56ae052d8e19c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡提供無償的愛\\n寶可夢之家"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town005_kanban_04",
      "hash": "e9b569e052d8dfe9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是寶可夢的安息之塔\\n寶可夢塔"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_01",
      "hash": "dd108a5f7ce63432",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳相信\\n世上真的有幽靈嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_02",
      "hash": "dd10895f7ce6327f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哦～\\n原來真的有人相信啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_town005_juveniles_01_03",
      "hash": "dd10885f7ce630cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊哈哈！就是說嘛！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的右肩上搭著一隻\\n白色的手什麼的……\\r\\n一定是我看錯了呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town005_adultm_01",
      "hash": "85160d0b0641adba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個城鎮因為\\n寶可夢的墳墓而聞名……\\c\\n當自己養育的寶可夢去世之後，\\n我們會把牠帶到寶可夢塔裡面，\\r\\n為牠們祈求冥福……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_town005_youngm_01",
      "hash": "992c8d4ceabdd3c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說最近寶可夢塔\\n有幽靈出現……\\c\\n那好像是被火箭隊\\n擄走而失蹤的\\r\\n寶可夢的幽靈……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_town005_oldf_01",
      "hash": "2d0312137a06f17c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈啊～\\n薰香的氣味真治癒啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_town005_poke_01",
      "hash": "575f74472b704770",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "尼多蘭「趴趴～"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_town005_childf_01",
      "hash": "e3b08901e734d73f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在寶可夢塔裡面\\n不可以喧嘩喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_town005_max",
      "hash": "28597b37fbf817c7"
    }
  ]
}
